o della propria mamma.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wEKHsn66OksrsbEKE2ZlHOleMu5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wEKHsn66OksrsbEKE2ZlHOleMu5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/20353/season/2/episode/15"},{"id":"582534","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Una notte da ricordare","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Doremì e Bibì portano Hanna a casa loro per dare una tregua a Raganella e Lala, ma i nuovi poteri della piccola rendono le cose molto difficili.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uHP5JwG9xHdROD0U0GLEUOKliSB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uHP5JwG9xHdROD0U0GLEUOKliSB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/20353/season/2/episode/16"},{"id":"582536","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"È una visita, non una gara!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Hanna ha l'appuntamento mensile della visita pediatrica dalla severa strega dottoressa Maia (Majo Heart). La bambina deve superare la prova di camminare a gattoni.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-05-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rPdCrhRIwKkOE2Htlowk5mP51cZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rPdCrhRIwKkOE2Htlowk5mP51cZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/20353/season/2/episode/17"},{"id":"582504","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Un'amica preziosa","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sentendosi sfruttata dalla sua padrona, Dodò si ribella e scappa via.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"